          "docs": "This endpoint provides helpful context in JSON format about the atmospheric weather parameters and operations that the other endpoints support.\n\nUse query parameters to control the results in the response body:\n  * Set `category` to `current-conditions`, `hourly-forecast`, or `hourly-historical` to filter atmospheric parameters by that category.\n  * Specify a `name` to filter atmospheric parameters by that name (e.g., `name=airTemp`).\n  * Specify a `category` and `name` to filter by both.\n  * Om"
